.policy "ruff-fix004-line-contains-hack" revision 2
.description "Replace the workaround a HACK comment marks with a proper solution before shipping, then remove the comment."
.language python
.mode steer
.scope include "**/*"

// Ruff FIX004 (flake8-fixme): a comment holding the task tag `HACK`, in any case, as the first word after a `#`
// (python/misc-comments). Reported at the comment; Ruff reports at the tag, on the same line.
//   # HACK: something           ← FIX004
//   # a # hack                  ← FIX004: after another `#`
//   # HACKS                     not reported: not the whole word
#include "python/misc-comments.rr"

.violation FIX004(at: node, d: symbol) code "FIX004"
    "Replace the workaround this `{d}` comment describes with a proper solution, then remove the `{d}` note; if no better solution exists yet, leave it."
    suppress ruff "FIX004"
FIX004(c, d) :- fixme_tag(c, "hack", d).
